usage: build-fight-value.py [-h] [--fold-dir FOLD_DIR] [--work WORK]
                            [--rollout-notes ROLLOUT_NOTES] [--states STATES]
                            [--runs RUNS] [--decisions DECISIONS]
                            [--game-data GAME_DATA] [--character CHARACTER]
                            [--rows ROWS] [--out OUT] [--notes NOTES]
                            [--gates GATES] [--trees TREES]
                            {extract,train,all,rollout-report,folds}

Fight value model from our own logs (live only as facts for Jev:
agent/src/reflex/rollout-live.ts).

positional arguments:
  {extract,train,all,rollout-report,folds}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --fold-dir FOLD_DIR   folds: where the out-of-fold models and gates go
  --work WORK           rollout-report: the work dir of tools/rollout-
                        backtest.ts
  --rollout-notes ROLLOUT_NOTES
  --states STATES
  --runs RUNS
  --decisions DECISIONS
  --game-data GAME_DATA
  --character CHARACTER
                        the character's knowledge id (default ironclad)
  --rows ROWS           default data/fight-value-rows.jsonl (another
                        character: -<id> before .jsonl)
  --out OUT             default knowledge/characters/<character>/fight-
                        value.json
  --notes NOTES         default notes/fight-value-backtest.md (another
                        character: -<id> before .md)
  --gates GATES         default knowledge/characters/<character>/fight-value-
                        gates.json
  --trees TREES
